      "evidence": "p3 eight blue3011 arranged as14x6 perimeter with hidden10x2 opening; each has40LDU overlap onto lower12x4 red platform. Top12x4 red course cross-bonds. Visible outer one-stud ledge preserved, hidden exact bond not uniquely shown."
