    {
      "key": "upper-bar-expanded",
      "classification": "explicit-layout-adjustment",
      "evidence": "p6 source top blue appears to fully cover short red ends, whereas implemented18stud span leaves outer2stud red tops exposed. Same-axis75349 and75350 confirmed by independent source inspection. Upper short centresX+/-280 adjacent to long ends+/-200; blue caps centred+/-200 overlap each80LDU. Lower blue centre+/-280 and short red atY+72. Fourteen-stud co-planar version overlaps solid parts; no reliable hidden stagger established. Parent approved this physically cross-bonded development candidate under user's reasonable-shape-adjustment authorization, not exact source or acceptance."
    },
    {
      "key": "vertical-pivot",
      "classification": "evidence-insufficient",
      "evidence": "6523 axis maps toY, centreY-808, endpoints-908/-708; source p5 upright gear shaft through long brick and torso stud gap. True bore/clutch/gear retention not proved; generic brick bbox does not validate it."
    },
    {
      "key": "arch-wheel",
      "classification": "real-geometry-risk",
      "evidence": "6394 source arch cutoutX+/-40,Y48..96. Horizontal6527 wheel radius41.00248 lies atarch localY76 with20halfthickness: width nominally2.00496LDU too wide at central radial extremity. Exact angular faces/physical fit pending; NOT cleared as bbox false positive."
    },
    {
      "key": "four-bar",
      "classification": "explicit-pose-adjustment",
      "evidence": "Upper side pins72LDU apart vertically. Lower red brick end holes80LDU apart transformed to(77.459667,20) inXY. Solving equal400LDU beam endpoint distances yields exact nominal four-bar closure. ShaftsZ span+/-120; red bodiesZ+/-40, back wheelsZ-60, front beamZ60 and front wheelZ100. Two independent source columns are inferred; chosen tilt clears waist and does not claim exact source angle or moving validation."
    },
    {
      "key": "adjacent-wheels",
      "classification": "real-mesh-risk",
      "evidence": "Four upper wheel pairs72LDU apart and four lower pairs80LDU apart in same axial planes, actual6527 radius41.00248. Earlier exact same-part80LDU witness established surface crossings;72LDU is also unresolved. Keep source quantity/nominal shafts, no collision exemption or claim of physical failure/success."
    },
    {
      "key": "weights",
      "classification": "source-supported-with-layout-inference",
      "evidence": "p10 four3011 per end stacked4courses on2x4 red weight brick. First rendered candidate incorrectly stacked upward. Actual current-source comparison p10/11 prompted180degree rotation about each lower Z-axis: lower red block and4blue bricks now point down; its unordered pair of80LDU end-hole centres stays identical. Both blue weight centres shift inward48LDU but remain well beyond waist edgeX280. Source exact hidden seam and pivot angle still inferred."
    },
